# Bun OS WSL distro: base set (Arch core/extra). No kernel, no firmware, no NVIDIA: WSL supplies the kernel
# and /dev/dxg + /usr/lib/wsl/lib come from the Windows host driver.
base
base-devel
sudo
git
openssh
curl
jq
less
nano
man-db
man-pages
ca-certificates
zstd
which
bash-completion
iproute2
inetutils
# graphics userspace for WSLg (Mesa d3d12 gallium driver is part of `mesa`; vulkan-dzn is the Vulkan-on-D3D12 ICD)
mesa
vulkan-dzn
vulkan-icd-loader
libva-mesa-driver
mesa-utils
wayland
xorg-xwayland
xorg-xeyes
pipewire-pulse
# Rust toolchain used by the kernel and by buncc (distro rust, not rustup)
rust
rust-src
rust-bindgen
clang
lld
npm
